		{
			description: ["Keep your Eccentric Tome close. Choose a manual from it when you need help with a mod, or open the Outlandish Player Handbook for advice about the whole pack. JEI shows the exact recipes; the questbook gives you goals. Craft the tome if you need a replacement. Its manuals are supplied through the pack."]
