		{
			dependencies: ["477E683DB97FE730"]
			description: ["Hold your Ultimine key while breaking a block to mine a connected selection. Search for Ultimine in Controls to find your keybind. Check the highlighted blocks before committing: some related blocks can be grouped together. Bring food and watch tool durability. Avoid using a large selection against your own building."]
