		{
			dependencies: ["477E683DB97FE730"]
			description: ["Lootr chests are locked separately for each player. Craft lockpicks before exploring: each pick has 50 durability, and each use costs one durability. Opening a chest unlocks your own loot. Your teammate must unlock it separately and gets their own loot; you do not empty the chest for one another."]
