		{
			dependencies: ["5ACC919AC3DF3092"]
			description: ["Use the MultiBeds Bed Kit to make your bed, then explore the available bed designs and bedding choices in JEI. Set up a comfortable sleeping spot near your workshop. When changing your bed, use the new one again so you know where you will return."]
