		{
			dependencies: ["477E683DB97FE730"]
			description: ["Realistic Horse Genetics gives horses inherited coat colours and performance traits. Tame a horse, saddle it and try its speed and jump before choosing a travelling companion. Size matters here: very small equines cannot carry an adult rider. Keep your horse out of combat, because nearby monsters can spook it."]
