		{
			dependencies: ["6F2C8E93751CA847"]
			description: ["Make a safe enclosure with room to move, good lighting and an easy entrance. Carry a lead for handling animals. Saddled horses are configured to stay put when unattended, but an enclosure is still a useful home. Leave space between breeding groups: stallions can drive rivals away from mares."]
