		{
			dependencies: ["05560C53E220C6CC"]
			description: ["Choose breeding stock for the traits you care about: appearance, speed, jump and health. These traits use genetics in this pack, so a foal is not simply a copy of the faster parent. Inspect your animals and keep notes across generations. Use the mod’s inspection and genetics information instead of judging only by coat colour."]
