		{
			dependencies: ["477E683DB97FE730"]
			description: ["The installed Realm RPG modules are Dragon Wyrms, Pots and Mimics, and Fallen Adventurers. Watch the terrain and investigate unusual sights carefully. Fallen adventurers add remains to discover; they are not all hostile skeleton enemies. Pots and Mimics make exploration less predictable, while wyrms add another reason to watch your surroundings."]
