		{
			dependencies: ["337E5CA4645C2C51"]
			description: ["When investigating pots or suspicious containers, clear a little space and keep an escape route. A mimic is an encounter, not a normal chest. Bring your weapon, food and spare inventory room. Return to safety to sort finds before pushing deeper into an unfamiliar structure."]
