		{
			dependencies: ["477E683DB97FE730"]
			description: ["Nullscape overhauls the End’s terrain. Plan for dramatic height changes and awkward gaps while exploring the outer islands. Carry blocks and Ender Pearls, and avoid assuming that a distant ledge is an easy jump. Your team must earn End access first; entering it also unlocks Twilight Forest."]
