		{
			dependencies: ["477E683DB97FE730"]
			description: ["Progressive Bosses changes the fights themselves and offers stronger summon variants. In this version, the Wither has several forms selected through Corrupted Soul Sand, and the Dragon has a corrupted form summoned with Corrupted End Crystals. Prepare for the version you summon. These are additional challenges; the Hovering Inferno remains the pack’s final boss."]
